      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T23:23:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that while BlameCache caches the resulting blame regions based on (repository, id, path, ignoreIds), getIgnoreIds reads and parses the .git-blame-ignore-revs blob from the tree on every request to construct the cache key.\n\nFor repositories with large ignore-revs files or frequent blame queries on the same commit, resolving and reading the tree object each time may add overhead even on cache hits. If needed down the road, caching parsed ignore-revs sets keyed by commit or tree ObjectId could avoid repeated git tree lookups.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "6db1368e5d70cb0213a85a10ce19be30744eff2c",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
